  },
  {
   "id": "d79f982c-5347-48c9-a4ad-4b2ac64585f7",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Research / New Evidence"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "eee0d45f-e87f-4fd0-9887-5accd1fd23b8",
   "type": "heading_3",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "FACT"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "fa1f1810-e66f-4007-92b9-e17d3fd8265b",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "GitHub's official API supports creation of an authenticated user's repository through POST /user/repos; fine-grained tokens require repository-creation write permission or administration write permission. This proves GitHub capability, not that the connected GitHub tool exposes an authorized creation action."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d2cce0e5-487e-40a7-bfc7-c3ef6a4cf2e8",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Cloudflare Workflows is available on Free and Paid and provides durable multi-step execution, retries, persisted state, and observability."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "cc45f7a7-7807-4a8e-839d-62034a5af27e",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Current Cloudflare documentation states that Workers Free has a 1,024-step Workflow limit, while Paid can be configured up to 25,000 steps; Free state/log retention is limited to 3 days."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "18e5345a-eeab-46bc-beca-c59cc7069a9f",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Cloudflare Workflows billing now applies to CPU time, requests, storage, and steps; it must not be described as unlimited $0/month infrastructure."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9e082534-967a-496e-9179-27737bb72b1d",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Oracle OCI Always Free currently provides up to 2 OCPUs / 12 GB memory equivalent for Ampere A1 compute within its Always Free allowance, but provisioning depends on tenancy/home-region capacity and eligibility."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "5bd26f8e-a6c0-417c-a5d1-ba0b2213aed1",
   "type": "heading_3",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "INTERPRETATION"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d3887397-b838-44b0-9e3f-993aa9fe9009",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Cloudflare Workflows is a strong orchestration candidate, but not sufficient by itself as the sole long-lived system-of-record for the Central Runtime under the current Free retention limits. External durable state remains required for durable queue/history requirements."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "754d6de3-2c8c-44fc-8263-c85400c10c3e",
   "type": "heading_3",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "UNKNOWN"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "350900ef-c5a7-4acf-b65d-e8fb9dd6a059",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Authorized independent repository creation path."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "2c86b890-6e09-4104-8d90-4f2fc8c56cce",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Oracle tenancy eligibility, home region, capacity, and deployment path."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "a13c9c76-70ce-49b3-ba5f-d830ce30ca47",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Production billing authorization."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "f9060543-936f-4ae4-a8ac-54ae94dc35b1",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent Alternatives"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "1d08dc34-ba70-4334-b66d-b116a033d0af",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent GitHub Repository + Cloudflare Workflows + external durable state — strongest managed orchestration candidate."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "0492d7cf-e41d-4416-9443-1f7df767aac5",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent GitHub Repository + self-owned Control Plane/Worker + durable database/queue — strongest explicit control model."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "053f4bcd-67e8-46ca-b30a-dc0ad6e33a9a",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent Repository + Render Worker + paid durable state — viable but requires paid-resource authorization."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "5bdc8f9a-2eb0-4b16-a0ae-e0a4d89d89b9",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent Repository + Oracle Always Free Compute — viable candidate for a self-owned worker/control plane if tenancy and capacity are verified."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "6a2aea51-6680-4ea4-a780-26f1cc0c6742",
   "type": "numbered_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Independent GitLab/Bitbucket Repository + independent compute — technically possible, but no connected creation path is verified."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "754ac6cd-1d09-4fab-b953-35098028fede",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Decision"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "fecb8754-eba6-482f-97c6-a44e3f25ceb4",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "KEEP REPOSITORY ISOLATION GATE."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "4b69cce3-e16d-41c3-b4f1-e26242d20c55",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not use or modify Umm-sara, main, or umm-sarah-web as Central Runtime infrastructure."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "2297f38d-25fe-4c84-9a3e-45ee1d5e24f6",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not create paid resources without explicit authorization."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "3ec02726-05a4-4175-9dfc-238295e5c05c",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Do not treat Cloudflare Workflows Free as a complete durable system-of-record."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "1ebb8855-e7af-4233-93fd-02b93197a240",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Side-Effect Check"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "d8182d5a-6166-46b3-a601-d830e87d6155",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Any repository or infrastructure mutation would cross the current isolation/authorization boundary. Therefore no mutation is safe or authorized in this cycle."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "9238094a-ea24-447a-ab4e-0d98f39bdeb9",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Fix Applied"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "db11265c-10e9-4bdb-bfca-2ce258f2ad88",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Read-only reconciliation + fresh official-source validation only."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "bbf575ac-37ef-4756-aa6e-9891b424d64f",
   "type": "paragraph",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "No business repository mutation. No branch mutation. No paid resource creation. No deployment."
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "508bec4c-8c7a-4d6c-aa8b-58f2c0492f97",
   "type": "heading_2",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Verification"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
   "id": "129e074b-2457-4993-8cf0-e3ffbb1c38b8",
   "type": "bulleted_list_item",
   "has_children": false,
   "text": [
    "Central trigger count = VERIFIED: 1"
   ],
   "created": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z",
   "edited": "2026-09-28T02:06:00.000Z"
  },
  {
